    owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/mc2-center/mc2-model/ChairRolesEnum#Annual%20Meeting> <https://w3id.org/mc2-center/mc2-model/ChairRolesEnum#None> <https://w3id.org/mc2-center/mc2-model/ChairRolesEnum#Steering%20Committee> <https://w3id.org/mc2-center/mc2-model/ChairRolesEnum#Working%20Group> ) ;
