        mc2:DSPDatasetAssayEnum,
        mc2:MeasurementTechniqueEnum ;
    skos:definition "5C (\"chromosome conformation capture carbon copy\") is an extension of the 3C technique that uses ligation-mediated amplification to study the 3-dimensional organization of multiple genomic loci in parallel." .

